# Firebase client config files are committed intentionally: CI (Codemagic)
# builds from a clean clone and the Google Services Gradle plugin / Xcode
# build both fail without them. They contain public client identifiers that
# ship inside every APK/IPA anyway — not secrets. Access control lives in
# Compile-time secrets (copy api_keys.json.example → api_keys.json).
# Never commit real keys. Injected via:
#   flutter run --dart-define-from-file=api_keys.json
api_keys.json
dart_defines.json

